---
title: Run Only Tasks Affected by a PR
description: Run only the tasks a pull request reaches with nx affected, which selects each task whose inputs your change touches and skips the rest.
sidebar:
  order: 13

filter: 'type:Features'
---

As your workspace grows, rerunning every test, build, and lint task on each pull request gets too slow.
`nx affected` runs only the tasks your change reaches: Nx finds the files your branch changed and selects each task whose inputs include one of them.
[Paired with remote caching and distribution](#best-paired-with-remote-caching-and-distribution), it cuts both CI time and compute.

